flowchart TB
  subgraph Request[Request]
    A([Submit request]) --> B{Input valid?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Queue job]
    B -->|No| D[Show issues]
    D -.->|Correct and retry| A
  end
  subgraph Processing[Processing]
    C --> E[[Process job]]
    E <--> F[(Reference database)]
    E --> G([Report ready])
  end
